ed Fundraising Data\";s:7:\"content\";s:108:\"<p>We’re thrilled to announce a powerful new addition to Charitable Pro: Google Analytics Integration!</p>\";s:4:\"type\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:111;s:5:\"start\";s:19:\"2025-08-06 03:13:10\";s:19:\"allow_on_activation\";b:1;s:17:\"notification_type\";s:7:\"success\";s:4:\"btns\";a:1:{s:4:\"main\";a:2:{s:3:\"url\";s:179:\"https://www.wpcharitable.com/introducing-google-analytics-integration/?utm_campaign=liteplugin&utm_source=WordPress&utm_medium=notifications&utm_content=See%20All%20Features%20109\";s:4:\"text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";}}}i:3;a:8:{s:5:\"title\";s:65:\"Introducing DonorTrust: Social Proof With Your Donation Campaigns\";s:7:\"content\";s:174:\"<p>Plus and Pro plan users: This new addon shows real-time notifications of recent donations - a great way to build trust and encourage more people to give to your cause!</p>\";s:4:\"type\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:110;s:5:\"start\";s:19:\"2025-07-25 03:13:10\";s:19:\"allow_on_activation\";b:1;s:17:\"notification_type\";s:7:\"success\";s:4:\"btns\";a:1:{s:4:\"main\";a:2:{s:3:\"url\";s:161:\"https://www.wpcharitable.com/introducing-donortrust/?utm_campaign=liteplugin&utm_source=WordPress&utm_medium=notifications&utm_content=See%20All%20Features%20109\";s:4:\"text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";}}}i:4;a:8:{s:5:\"title\";s:60:\"Introducing Built-in Square Integration for Charitable Users\";s:7:\"content\";s:163:\"<p>We\'re excited to announce that Square payments are now available to everyone using Charitable - both Lite and Pro users in the latest versions (1.8.7)! 🎊</p>\";s:4:\"type\";b:0;s:2:\"id\";i:109;s:5:\"start\";s:19:\"2025-07-09 03:13:10\";s:19:\"allow_on_activation\";b:1;s:17:\"notification_type\";s:7:\"success\";s:4:\"btns\";a:1:{s:4:\"main\";a:2:{s:3:\"url\";s:178:\"https://www.wpcharitable.com/introducing-built-in-square-integration/?utm_campaign=liteplugin&utm_source=WordPress&utm_medium=notifications&utm_content=See%20All%20Features%20109\";s:4:\"text\";s:10:\"Learn More\";}}}i:5