brate the official opening of SHASA’s 8th Heatwave &amp; Bushfire Haven at the Southern Life Church Moruya. Learn more about the Food Pantry too.<br>Hope you can join us !</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"linkTo\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":527,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/61f34b_68553c1fb4334c1db04e584ae3b6a9e8mv2.webp\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-527\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":530,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/unnamed-1024x570.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-530\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":279,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"http://172.19.125.1:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-4.jpeg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-279\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></figure>\n<!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Heatwave &amp; Bushfire Haven Official Opening','','draft','open','open','','heatwave-bushfire-haven-official-opening','','','2025-10-21 12:55:26','2025-10-21 01:55:26','',0,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?post_type=album&#038;p=634',0,'album','',0),(635,1,'2025-10-14 12:20:56','2025-10-14 01:20:56','<strong>Help Rebuild Tilba’s Heart ❤️</strong>\r\n\r\nThe two historic Tilba halls are being lovingly restored to preserve their heritage and transform them into safe, accessible, and vibrant community spaces. Your donation supports essential upgrades and ensures these cherished buildings continue to serve generations to come.','Tilba\'s Halls','','inherit','closed','closed','','531-autosave-v1','','','2025-10-14 12:20:56','2025-1