 Resources</a> (many items are available for NFPs to borrow, pdf 50kb)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><a href=\"https://shasa.com.au/wp-content/uploads/2024/12/SHASA-Position-Descriptions.pdf\">Position Description</a> (pdf 75kb)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The following documents are available upon request. Please email <a href=\"mailto:contact.shasa@gmail.com\">contact.shasa@gmail.com</a>&nbsp;</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Risk Assessment Plan (by request)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Code of Conduct (by request)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Conflict of Interest (by request)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>SHASA Finance Report (by request)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Funding for this page was provided by the FRRR Investing in Rural Communities Futures Program</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://ircf.frrr.org.au/\">https://ircf.frrr.org.au/</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Governance','','inherit','closed','closed','','786-revision-v1','','','2025-10-21 12:08:21','2025-10-21 01:08:21','',786,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=789',0,'revision','',0),(790,1,'2025-10-21 12:08:22','2025-10-21 01:08:22','<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header\",\"theme\":\"twentytwentyfive\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://172.19.125.15:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/banner-1024x427.png\",\"id\":163,\"dimRatio\":50,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#7f93b6\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":false,\"focalPoint\":{\"x\":0.17,\"y\":0.51},\"minHeight\":580,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"isDark\":false,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"className\":\"no-margin\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light no-margin\" style=\"min-height:580px\"><img 