wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">Collaboration &amp; Community Engagement</mark></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We actively collaborate with other community groups and volunteers to enhance service capability and resourcing.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We run the Repair Cafe to engage with the community, build skills, resilience, and reduce waste to landfill.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We actively partner with businesses aligned with our vision for a resilient community &amp; low carbon economy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We seek to broaden our membership, volunteer work, and project focus to recognise our diverse community.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We rely on the commitment, goodwill, and capability of our volunteers, and them grow through mentoring, coaching, positive experiences, social events, and training.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We keep the community informed through our regular newsletters, website and Facebook.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">Creating a more resilient and healthy community</mark></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We engage in projects that deliver renewable energy, solar install programs, batteries on community facilities, and support local research and development of renewable power generation, batteries, and energy efficient appliances.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We promote the transition to electric vehicles and EV charger networks, electric public transport, cycling, and walking.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We support and help develop heatwave and bushfire smoke havens.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We promote regional food security and partner with other organisations to facilitate food delivery to those in need.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><mark style=\"background-color:rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)\" class=\"has-inline-color has-accent-1-color\">Advocacy &amp; Information</mark></h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item {\"fontSize\":\"medium\"} -->\n<li class=\"has-medium-font-size\">We inform and advocate to all levels of government on the climate crisis, renewables, electric transport, and social justice.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->','SHASA\'s Strategic Plan 2030','','inherit','closed','closed','','871-revision-v1','','','2025-10-21 14:00:01','2025-10-21 03:00:01','',871,'http://172.19.125.1:8080/?p=888',0,'revision','',0),(890,1,'2025-10-21 14:07:41','2025-10-21 03:07:41','<!-- wp:template-part {\"slug\":\"header-no-image\",\"theme\":\"twentytwentyfive\",\"area\":\"header\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"http://172.19.125.111:8080/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/3-1.jpeg\",\"id\":232,\"dimRatio\":50,\"overlayColor\":\"contrast\